[32m+[m[32mModbus settings are grouped at the top of [main/modbus_sensor.c](main/modbus_sensor.c): unit ID `1`, input register function `0x04`, zero-based register address `0`, 9600 baud, 8N1, and scale `1.0` with offset `0.0`. Change these to match the connected device. The default measurement is an unsigned 16-bit register value converted as `raw * scale + offset`.[m
